    "title": "Banbridge Chronicle, 8 May 1964, p. 1 (\"Eight for Dromore's Nine Seats\"); Ulster Star, 9 May 1964, p. 4 (\"Dromore Topics\"); Ulster Star, 30 May 1964, p. 20 (\"Dromore Topics\"); Banbridge Chronicle, 5 June 1964, p. 1 (\"Councillor to Continue\")",
